    {
      "id": "claim_f9d2f068c9c14b78b084f09de9ef4411",
      "statement": "Init assembles pki options by deployment type (standalone: first JWK provisioner + super admin subject; linked or --remote-management: WithAdmin; --ssh non-linked: WithSSH; --no-db: WithNoDB; --helm: WithHelm, which renders a Helm values YAML to stdout instead of saving), and --provisioner-password-file overrides the CA password when generating standalone provisioner key pairs; the final state is persisted with p.Save().",
